    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2015_0320","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Ásdís Zielińska talks about why the frame is the real work. Background noise: a gallery fan, rain, and someone hammering a nail into a work in progress.</Description>
